HUD Scale adds HUD scale and text size sliders to the settings window. It works in any game language. By default, it reduces the game's main HUD zoom from 1.3 to 1.0.

I made this mod because Survival Log's HUD feels oversized in English. The layout appears to favor compact Chinese text. English labels overlap, quest lines end in "...", and plant and trap names wrap onto two lines.

Reducing the zoom to 1.0 makes the HUD about 23% smaller and greatly reduces overlap in my testing. Some text can still exceed its boxes.

[size=5]Main features[/size]
[list]
[*][b]Scale.[/b] Resize the main HUD's text, icons, and boxes together. The default is 1.00, which makes the HUD about 23% smaller than the game's 1.30.[/*]
[*][b]Text Scale.[/b] Adjust text and icons that use font sizes without resizing their boxes. The default is 1.00. If you also want smaller text, try 0.90.[/*]
[*][b]Live preview.[/b] Preview changes while you drag a slider. Release it to save the value. Click its number to restore the mod's default.[/*]
[/list]

The cooking window, containers, event pop-ups, and other windows keep their size. Labels over furniture and characters in the world also keep their size. To restore the game's HUD sizes, set [b]Scale[/b] to 1.30 and [b]Text Scale[/b] to 1.00.

[size=5]Requirements[/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/survivallog/mods/12]BepInEx for Survival Log[/url]. Install it first.[/*]
[/list]

[size=5]Installation[/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/survivallog/mods/12]BepInEx[/url] [i](if no other mods were installed before, start the game once so BepInEx finishes setup, then quit)[/i].[/*]
[*]Extract this mod's zip into the game folder (the folder with the game .exe). The DLL lands in BepInEx\plugins. Full path example:
[list]
[*]Steam:
[code]C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Survival Log\BepInEx\plugins\HudScale.dll[/code]
[/*]
[/list]
[/*]
[/list]

[size=5]Uninstall[/size]
Delete HudScale.dll from the BepInEx\plugins folder.

[size=5]Configuration[/size]
[list=1]
[*]Load a save.[/*]
[*]Press Esc.[/*]
[*]Open [b]Settings[/b].[/*]
[*]Adjust [b]Scale[/b] or [b]Text Scale[/b] in the [b]HUD[/b] panel below [b]Action Feedback[/b].[/*]
[/list]

The HUD panel is available only after a save loads. The mark under each slider shows the mod's default. Clicking the number restores that default, which is 1.00 for both sliders.

The mod saves settings in [font=Courier New]BepInEx\config\com.ivmakk.survivallog.hudscale.cfg[/font], which it creates when you first start the game with the mod installed. You can also edit this file in a text editor. Close the settings window before you edit the file. File edits apply when you next open the settings window or load a save. No restart is needed. See [url=https://github.com/ivmakk-sl/sl-hud-scale/blob/main/CONFIG.md]CONFIG.md[/url] for the config keys, defaults, and limits.

